Spit slime at your target doing [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; MP 100)] nature damage and slowing it down by 30% for 3 turns.

The slime can bounce from foe to foe, hitting up to a total of [1, 2, 3, 4, 5 (TL1-5)] target(s).

Additional targets must be within 6 tiles of each other and the slime loses [58%, 49%, 43%, 38%, 34% (TL1-5)] damage per bounce.

The damage will increase with your Mindpower
